4199
00:13:16,650 --> 00:13:19,030
<font face="Bahij Nassim" size="111"><b>!ما-ما-ما هذا الشّيء؟</b></font>

4200
00:13:28,540 --> 00:13:31,710
<font face="Bahij Nassim" size="111"><b>!وحش بحري</b></font>

4201
00:13:33,830 --> 00:13:38,340
<font face="Bahij Nassim" size="111"><b>...سمعتُ صوت امرأة... طالبة النّجدة</b></font>

4202
00:13:38,340 --> 00:13:39,170
<font face="Bahij Nassim" size="111"><b>!وحش؟</b></font>

4203
